2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 1 JAN 1835
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tjora
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 DEC 1912
