1 NAME Anna Larsdatter /Meland/
2 GIVN Anna Larsdatter
2 SURN Meland
2 _MARNM Søre Sunde
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1774
2 PLAC Meland
2 ADDR
