2 CONT * http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?show=47&uid=490146&urnread_imagesize=full&hode=nei&ls=1&lc=x%259CK%25B42%25B2%25AA.%25B62%25B4R%25CAT%25B2.%25B62%25B1R2434%25031%2581B%25C5J%25D6%2599V%2526%25E6%25D6%25B5%2500%25BF%2594%25
