1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From his great-great-granddaughter Sylvia Wallace:
2 CONT
2 CONT Andreas Larsen immigrated to US in 1854. He married Anne Halvorsdtr in 1860 in Illinois, he participated in the US Civil War but seems to have deserted. He and Anne had 3 children in 1860s, but by 1870, Anne and kids are in Nebras
2 CONC ka alone. She remarries in 1872. But Andreas (Andrew here) shows up in the 1875 Norwegian census, listed as a pauper, ill, and living with his brother Salemon Larsen. The census says he left a wife in the US in 1873. He died in Ha
2 CONC aland in 1898. 
2 CONT
