1 NAME Enok Rasmussen //
2 GIVN Enok Rasmussen
2 SURN Ølberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 MAR 1869
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE 1915
